.vexus/
# Explicit belt-and-suspenders for eval fixture corpora: index artifacts
# from ad-hoc `vexus index eval/corpora/...` runs must never be committed
# (the `.vexus/` pattern above already covers this at any depth, but the
# eval fixtures get their own line since it's load-bearing for that gate).
eval/**/.vexus/
# Written by `vexus-eval run` on every invocation (local + CI eval-gate) —
# a fresh, regeneratable artifact, not ground truth (unlike
# eval/baseline-mock.json, which a later Plan 5 task commits deliberately).
eval/last-run.json
.superpowers/
/target
